  Allowed
  - Use Cipher yourself
  - Change the code for your own use
  - Send improvements back via pull request

  Not allowed
  - Share, publish, or redistribute Cipher (original or modified)
  - Put up your own public fork/releases for others to download
  - Sell it or use it commercially

  Short version: personal use + PRs back here = OK. Giving Cipher (or your
  modified build) to other people = not OK.

